<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="Last updated: 30 July 2026">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>To activate and manage your licence we store your email address, a one-way hashed
  identifier of each Mac you activate, and your purchase history.</p>

  <h2>What we never collect</h2>
  <p><strong>We do not collect what you type.</strong> Converting your keystrokes to
  Devanagari happens entirely on your own Mac and is never sent anywhere. AksharaIME does
  contact our server periodically to check your licence is still valid — that request
  carries the hashed device identifier and your licence token, and nothing else. No
  keystrokes, no text, no application names, no timing information.</p>

  <h2>Who processes your data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Paddle.com</strong> — payment processing (Merchant of Record).
      <a href="https://www.paddle.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Their privacy policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — account authentication and licence storage.</li>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivering sign-in and account emails.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sign-in</h2>
  <p>We use passwordless sign-in — a one-time code by email, or Sign in with Google. We never
  store a password.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can request deletion of your account and associated data at any time by emailing us.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:om.chavan501@gmail.com">om.chavan501@gmail.com</a></p>
</Legal>
